<title>ITALY: FORECAST-Italy seen issuing 41.00 trln lire Bot.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Italy seen issuing 41.00 trln lire Bot.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury is expected to issue 41.0 trillion lire of short term bills (Bot) at its end-month auction against 41.75 trillion lire maturing, a Reuter poll of analysts showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Treasury is also expected to issue its regular tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of zero coupon certificates (Ctz).</p>
<p>The Treasury will announce on Friday the amounts of bills it will offer on auction on September 25. Settlment date for the bills is September 30.</p>
<p>Following are the analysts' forecasts (in trillion of lire):</p>
<p>			   3-Mo Bot   6-Mo Bot  1-Yr Bot  CTZ  TOT BOT</p>
<p>    Maturing	     13.00	14.25     14.50   ===  41.75</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Bank of America    12.50	13.75     14.00   2.5  40.25</p>
<p>    Banca di Roma	12.75	14.00     14.50   2.5  41.25</p>
<p>    Caboto		 13.00	14.00     14.25   2.5  41.25</p>
<p>    Credito Italiano   12.75	14.00     14.25   2.5  41.25</p>
<p>    Indosuez	     12.50	14.00     14.50   2.5  41.00</p>
<p>    Prometeia	    12.75	14.00     14.50   2.0  40.75</p>
<p>    Unattrib. bank	12.50	14.50     15.00   2.5  42.00</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    CONSENSUS	    12.70	14.00     14.40   2.5  41.00</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66101399</p>
